## Copyable HTTP Body (for quick paste)
Use this JSON in your HTTP request block, inserting the `prompt_template` variable using Automate's variable picker:

```
{
  "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
  "messages": [
    {"role": "user", "content": "{prompt_template}"}
  ],
  "max_tokens": 600,
  "temperature": 0.7
}
```

